Two possible solutions ahead
-- SPOILER --

1. You can pray if you are in good standing with your God every 300 turns or
   so. He will take care of your worst problem, which is your hunger in this
   case. Be careful not to pray too often.
2. You can eat some/most monsters you just killed. Take care that you start
   eating immediately after killing the monster, otherwise a eatable corpse
   may kill you. Not all monsters are eatable, so you may want to write down
   which are good. 

Hope this helps.
